Package: cnmarket
Type: Package
Title: A-Share Regime-Aware Market Data
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jieyu", "Yang", email = "yangjieyu1130@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides access to A-share (Mainland China) market data through
    the 'Tushare' API and the public 'Tencent' endpoint. Unlike
    general-purpose market-data packages, it is aware of the A-share trading
    regime: it derives daily price limits from the board (Main Board 10
    percent, STAR Market and ChiNext 20 percent, Beijing Stock Exchange 30
    percent) and ST status (5 percent), tags limit-up, limit-down and
    trading-halt (suspension) days, computes the next date a position can be
    sold under the T+1 rule, and supports forward and backward price
    adjustment (qfq / hfq) from adjustment factors. It also provides a
    non-seasonal ARIMA forecaster and an institution-aware multi-factor
    screening tool that filters by board, limit, streak and T+1 risk in
    addition to standard technical factors (moving averages, average true
    range, volume ratio, volatility), with an optional forecast-ahead pass.
    Every request is cached on disk for offline reuse and rate-limit
    friendliness.
